  "description": "Pre-registered matched-competitor protocol; selection and timing parameters are immutable after the first result. The v7 pinned Gluon compile envelope and smoke cases are development-only; no Gluon promotion occurs before independent H100 and B200 gates. The BF16 production-width primary profile uses only R=D and D>768: matched S=3/9 pairs at D=1024/2048/4096/8192 with N scaled to about 4.2 million elements per source, one S=33 depth cell at D=4096, and one D=7168 non-power-of-two generalization cell. Smaller smoke cases remain diagnostic-only and are excluded from adoption claims.",
